OL,3,GNEWSAEx-PC in court over rape and
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer accused of
OL,7,Fraping one woman and sexually
OL,8,Fassaulting another while off-duty has
OL,9,Fappeared in court.
OL,11,FMatthew Stewart, aged 31, worked for
OL,12,FCumbria Police as a special constable,
OL,13,Fcommunity support officer and police
OL,14,Fconstable from 2015 before leaving the
OL,15,Fprofession in 2024.
OL,17,FStewart, of Carlisle, faces one charge
OL,18,Falleging he raped a woman, a second
OL,19,Fcharge alleging he sexually assaulted a
OL,20,Fsecond woman and two further charges
OL,21,Fallege intentional strangulation.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
